<title>USA: Citibank sets up Deutsche Telekom ADR program.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets up Deutsche Telekom ADR program.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. said on Thursday it has established an American depositary receipt (ADR) program for Deutsche Telekom AG.</p>
<p>Each ADR share issued under the program represents one share of common stock. Citibank will serve as the depositary bank for the German telecommunications company.</p>
</text>
